"Report information about wrong responses to the <a "
"href=\":dblog\">log</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tuairiscigh faisnéis faoi fhreagraí míchearta chuig an <a "
"href=\":dblog\">log</a>."

msgid ""
"Note that the CAPTCHA module disables <a "
"href=\":performancesettings\">page caching</a> of pages that include a "
"CAPTCHA challenge."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara go ndéanann an modúl CAPTCHA múchadh ar <a "
"href=\":performancesettings\">taisce an leathanaigh</a> i gcás "
"leathanaigh ina bhfuil dúshlán CAPTCHA."

