msgstr "Ag bainistiú ailiasanna"

msgid ""
"An alias defines a different name for an existing URL path - for "
"example, the alias 'about' for the URL path 'node/1'. A URL path can "
"have multiple aliases."
msgstr ""
"Sainmhíníonn ailias ainm difriúil do chonair URL atá ann cheana "
"féin — mar shampla, an t-ailias ‘about’ don chonair URL "
"‘node/1’. Is féidir le conair URL iolraí ailias a bheith aici."

msgid "Administer URL aliases"
msgstr "Riar ailiasanna URL"

msgid "Create and edit URL aliases"
msgstr "Cruthaigh agus cuir eagar ar ailiasanna URL"

