"Allows the \"depth\" for Taxonomy: Term ID (with depth) to be modified "
"via an additional contextual filter value."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn sé an “doimhneacht” le haghaidh Aitheantais Téarma "
"(le doimhneacht) a mhodhnú trí luach breise scagaire "
"comhthéacsúil."

