msgid ""
"\n"
"        <p>You can align images, videos, blockquotes and so on to "
"the left, right or center. Examples:</p>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"          "
"<li>Align an image to the left: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" "
"data-align=\"left\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"          <li>Align an image "
"to the center: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"center\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"          <li>Align an image to the right: "
"<code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"right\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"       "
"   <li>… and you can apply this to other elements as well: "
"<code>&lt;video src=\"\" data-align=\"center\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"    "
"    </ul>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Is féidir leat íomhánna, físeáin, blocfhocla agus mar sin de a "
"ailíniú ar chlé, ar dheis nó sa lár. Samplaí:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"  "
"<li>Ailínigh íomhá ar chlé: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" "
"data-align=\"left\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"  <li>Ailínigh íomhá sa "
"lár: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"center\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"  <li>Ailínigh íomhá ar dheis: <code>&lt;img "
"src=\"\" data-align=\"right\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"  <li>… agus is "
"féidir leat é seo a chur i bhfeidhm ar eilimintí eile chomh maith: "
"<code>&lt;video src=\"\" data-align=\"center\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"</ul>"

msgid "Align images"
msgstr "Ailínigh na híomhánna"

msgid ""
"Uses a <code>data-align</code> attribute on <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> "
"tags to align images."
msgstr ""
"Baineann sé úsáid as tréith <code>data-align</code> ar chlibeanna "
"<code>&lt;img&gt;</code> chun íomhánna a ailíniú."

msgid ""
"\n"
"        <p>You can caption images, videos, blockquotes, and so on. "
"Examples:</p>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"            <li><code>&lt;img src=\"\" "
"data-caption=\"This is a caption\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"            "
"<li><code>&lt;video src=\"\" data-caption=\"The Drupal Dance\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"            <li><code>&lt;blockquote "
"data-caption=\"Dries Buytaert\"&gt;Drupal is "
"awesome!&lt;/blockquote&gt;</code></li>\n"
"            "
"<li><code>&lt;code data-caption=\"Hello world in "
"JavaScript.\"&gt;alert(\"Hello world!\");&lt;/code&gt;</code></li>\n"
"  "
"      </ul>"
msgstr ""
"```html\n"
"<p>Is féidir leat fotheidil a chur ar íomhánna, "
"físeáin, blocfhriotail, agus mar sin de. Samplaí:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    "
"<li><code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-caption=\"Seo fotheideal\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"    <li><code>&lt;video src=\"\" "
"data-caption=\"Damhsadh an Drupal\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"    "
"<li><code>&lt;blockquote data-caption=\"Dries Buytaert\"&gt;Tá Drupal "
"iontach!&lt;/blockquote&gt;</code></li>\n"
"    <li><code>&lt;code "
"data-caption=\"Dia duit an domhan i JavaScript.\"&gt;alert(\"Dia duit "
"an domhan!\");&lt;/code&gt;</code></li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"```"

