msgid ""
"Options such as paging, table sorting, and exposed filters will not "
"initiate a page refresh."
msgstr ""
"Ní thionscnóidh roghanna ar nós rothaí leathanach, sórtáil "
"tábla, agus scagairí nochta athnuachan leathanach."

