msgstr ""
"Cinntigh go bhfuil an modúl Bunúsach Shortcut suiteáilte, agus go "
"bhfuil ról agat leis an gcead <em>Edit current shortcut set</em> nó "
"<em>Administer shortcuts</em>. Chomh maith leis sin, cinntigh go "
"bhfuil modúl barra uirlisí suiteáilte (bíodh an modúl Bunúsach "
"Toolbar ann, nó modúl i dtreis a chuireann in áit é)."

msgid "Output Buffering"
msgstr "Stóráil Aschuir"

msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/en/function.ob-start.php\">Output "
"buffering</a> is not enabled. This may degrade Drupal's performance. "
"You can enable output buffering by default <a "
"href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/en/outcontrol.configuration.php#ini.output-buffering\">in "
"your PHP settings</a>."
msgstr ""
"Níl <a "
"href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/en/function.ob-start.php\">mhaolú "
"aschuir (output buffering)</a> cumasaithe. D’fhéadfadh sé sin "
"feidhmíocht Drupal a laghdú. Is féidir leat maolú aschuir a "
"chumasú de réir réamhshocraithe <a "
"href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/en/outcontrol.configuration.php#ini.output-buffering\">i "
"do shocruithe PHP</a>."

msgid ""
"Multibyte string input conversion in PHP is active and must be "
