"seo a leanas: @unknown_packages."

msgid ""
"If the Interface Translation module is installed, this page will "
"provide an overview of how much of the site's interface has been "
"translated for each configured language."
msgstr ""
"Má tá an modúl **Interface Translation** suiteáilte, soláthróidh "
"an leathanach seo forléargas ar an méid den chomhéadan atá "
"aistrithe do gach teanga atá cumraithe."

msgid ""
