"Drupal core does not automatically delete unused files because unused "
"files could reused."
msgstr ""
"Ní scriosann croí Drupal comhaid nach bhfuil in úsáid go "
"huathoibríoch, mar d’fhéadfaí comhaid neamhúsáidte a "
"athúsáid."

msgid ""
"All files must be uploaded to your production environment and then "
"copied to development and local environment."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór gach comhad a uaslódáil chuig do thimpeallacht táirgthe "
