msgstr ""
"Tá na leabharlanna seachtracha thíos riachtanach do na heilimintí "
"gréasáin nó do na modúil shonraithe."

msgid ""
"Uncheck the below settings to allow webform administrators to choose "
"which results should be replaced with submission views."
msgstr ""
"Díthiceáil na socruithe thíos chun go mbeidh cead ag riarthóirí "
