"The Webform Clientside Validation module helps support Webform "
"Clientside Validation integration. <a href=\":href\">Disable Webform "
"Clientside Validation warning</a>"
msgstr ""
"Cabhraíonn an modúl Webform Clientside Validation le tacaíocht a "
"thabhairt d’fheidhmiú an chomhtháthaithe Webform Clientside "
"Validation. <a href=\":href\">Díchumasaigh rabhadh Webform Clientside "
"Validation</a>"

