"target=\"blank\">Colorbox Load</a> and <a "
"href=\"@url_colorbox_inline\" target=\"blank\">Colorbox Inline</a>"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat teacht ar ghnéithe nua in <a "
"href=\"@url_colorbox_load\" target=\"blank\">Colorbox Load</a> agus in "
"<a href=\"@url_colorbox_inline\" target=\"blank\">Colorbox Inline</a>"

