"%title is a %type element, which has been disabled and will not be "
"rendered. Please contact a site administrator."
msgstr ""
"Is eilimint %type é %title, atá díchumasaithe agus ní "
"thaispeánfar é. Déan teagmháil le riarthóir an láithreáin le do "
