"Cards provide an almost identical user experience to wizard pages, but "
"moving between cards is much faster. Cards use JavaScript for "
"pagination and client-side validation. Cards also support "
"auto-forwarding with conditional logic."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn cártaí eispéireas úsáideora beagnach comhionann le "
"leathanaigh draoi, ach tá sé i bhfad níos tapúla bogadh idir "
"chártaí. Úsáideann cártaí JavaScript le haghaidh paginiú agus "
"bailíochtú ar thaobh an chliaint. Tacaíonn cártaí freisin le "
"huath-ar aghaidhú le loighic choinníollach."

