msgid ""
"Below is an example of how to programmatically validate and submit a "
"webform submission using PHP."
msgstr ""
"Seo thíos sampla de conas, trí chlárú, bailíochtú agus seoladh "
"i.e. cur isteach ar fhoirm ghréasáin a dhéanamh trí PHP."

msgid "Unable to parse CSV file. Please review the CSV file's formatting."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir an comhad CSV a pharsáil. Déan athbhreithniú ar "
"fhormáidiú an chomhaid CSV."

msgid "Administer webform overview"
msgstr "Riar an forbhreathnú ar webform"

msgid "Filter webforms and perform bulk actions on overview page."
msgstr ""
"Scag foirmeacha gréasáin agus déan gníomhartha mórchóirithe ar "
"an leathanach forbhreathnaithe."

msgid "File upload limit message"
msgstr "Teachtaireacht teorainn uaslódála comhad"

msgid "Check if an element is displayed"
msgstr "Seiceáil an bhfuil eilimint á taispeáint"

msgid "Default file upload limit per form message"
msgstr ""
"Teorainn réamhshocraithe uaslódála comhad in aghaidh na foirme – "
"teachtaireacht"

msgid "Webform deprecated modules"
msgstr "Modúil neamhúsáidte Webform"

msgid ""
"The following webform sub-modules have been deprecated: @module_list. "
"Please download the <a href=\":url\">Webform Deprecated</a> project."
msgstr ""
"Tá na fo-mhodúil seo a leanas de chuid an ghréasáincheistneora "
"(webform) imithe i léig: @module_list. Íoslódáil an tionscadal <a "
"href=\":url\">Webform Deprecated</a le do thoil."

msgid ""
"@element_file_limit limit per file. The accumulated size of all files "
"in this form cannot exceed @webform_file_limit."
msgstr ""
"@element_file_limit uasteorainn in aghaidh an chomhaid. Ní féidir le "
"méid carntha na gcomhad go léir san fhoirm seo dul thar "
"@webform_file_limit."

msgid ""
"The accumulated size of all files in this form cannot exceed "
"@webform_file_limit."
msgstr ""
"Ní fhéadfaidh méid carnach na gcomhad uile san fhoirm seo dul thar "
"@webform_file_limit."

msgid ""
"Note: This is only to be used with the Drupal Bootstrap Theme, NOT "
"with other Bootstrap Framework related Themes (like Radix)."
msgstr ""
"Nóta: Níor cheart é seo a úsáid ach leis an Ábhar Bootstrap de "
"chuid Drupal, NÁ le hábhair eile a bhaineann le fráma Bootstrap "
"(cosúil le Radix)."

msgid "Send on (date / datetime string or [token])"
msgstr "Seol ar (teaghrán dáta / amchláir nó [token])"

msgid "Please delete submissions from the %title webform."
msgstr "Scrios na cur isteach ón ngréasán %title."

msgid "%title webform has @total submissions."
msgstr "Tá @total cur isteach ag %title ar an bhfoirm ghréasáin."

msgid ""
"You may not delete %title webform until you have removed all of the "
"%title submissions."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir leat %title a scriosadh ón ngréasánform go dtí go "
"mbeidh tú tar éis gach ceann de na %title a bhaint."

msgid ""
"Please make sure to install additional <a "
"href=\":libraries_href\">third-party libraries</a>, <a "
"href=\":submodules_href\">sub-modules</a> and optional <a "
"href=\":ecosystem_href\">add-ons</a>."
msgstr ""
"Le do thoil, déan cinnte go suiteálann tú <a "
"href=\":libraries_href\">leabharlanna tríú páirtí</a> breise, <a "
"href=\":submodules_href\">fo-modúil</a> agus <a "
"href=\":ecosystem_href\">breiseáin roghnacha</a>."

msgid "File upload limit per form message"
msgstr ""
"Teachtaireacht maidir leis an teorainn uaslódála comhaid in aghaidh "
"an fhoirmleasa"

msgid ""
"Enter message to be displayed when file upload limit is reached. You "
"may use %quota as a placeholder."
msgstr ""
"Cuir isteach an teachtaireacht le taispeáint nuair a sroichtear an "
"teorainn uaslódála comhad. Is féidir leat **%quota** a úsáid mar "
"áititheoir."

msgid ""
"You must allow users to post submissions from a dedicated URL to use "
"open this webform is a dialog."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór duit cead a thabhairt do úsáideoirí cur isteach a "
"fhoilsiú ó URL tiomnaithe chun an gréasánfhoirm seo a oscailt mar "
"dialóg."

msgid "Please delete submissions from the selected webforms."
msgstr "Scrios na seoltaí ón ngréasfhoirm roghnaithe."

msgid "The selected webforms have a total of @total submissions."
msgstr ""
"Tá an líon iomlán @total cur isteach ag na webfhoirmeacha "
"roghnaithe."

msgid ""
"You may not delete these webforms until there is less than @batch "
"total submissions."
msgstr ""
"Ní fhéadfaidh tú na foirmeacha gréasáin seo a scriosadh go dtí "
"go mbeidh níos lú ná @batch iarratas iomlán curtha isteach."

msgid "Filter by data and/or notes"
msgstr "Scag de réir sonraí agus/nó nótaí"

msgid ""
"If checked, support option, displayed on the <a "
"href=\":help_href\">Help</a> page will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Má chuirtear as an ngné seo, déanfar an rogha tacaíochta a "
"thaispeántar ar an leathanach <a href=\":help_href\">Cabhrach</a a "
"dhíghníomhachtú."

