msgstr "Cinneann sé lonnú an teidil do chodanna dáta."

msgid ""
"For more advanced use-cases like rendered entities or more complex "
"entity filtering or sorting, you may want to use the \"Views: Filter "
"by an entity reference view\" reference method."
msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh cásanna úsáidí níos forbartha ar nós eintitis "
"rindreáilte nó scagadh nó sórtáil níos casta d’eintitis, "
"b’fhéidir go mbeadh tú ag iarraidh an modh “Views: Filter by an "
"entity reference view” a úsáid."

